<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-EUROPEAN INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EUROPEAN INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results from the</p>
<p>European indoor tennis championships on Monday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>6-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Petra Begerow</p>
<p>(Germany) 6-3 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>7-Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) beat Miriam Oremans</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Marianne Werdel Witmeyer (U.S.)</p>
<p>1-6 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Sandra Klelnova (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-3 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Silvia Farina (Italy) beat Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) 5-7 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>Anna Kournikova (Russia) beat 8-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) 2-6 7-6 (8-6) 6-4</p>
</text>
